## Why This Is Asked
- Tests practical migration of CNPA pipelines with downtime constraints.

## Key Concepts
- Zero-downtime schema evolution, dual-write, outbox, backfill, idempotency, rollback.

## Code Example
```javascript
// Pseudo: dual write with feature flag
async function publish(event, flagNew) {
  await writeToTopic('old-topic', event);
  if (flagNew) await writeToTopic('new-topic', upgrade(event));
  await upsertOutbox(event);
}
```

